[{"answer":"That seminar yesterday on automation and the future of work was really good, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Looking at the first industrial revolution in Britain in the 19th century","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and seeing how people reacted to massive change was a real eye opener.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/4.mp3"},{"answer":"It was interesting to hear how people felt about automation then","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/5.mp3"},{"answer":"and what challenges they faced.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't know that first started with workers in the textile industry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/7.mp3"},{"answer":"With those protesting workers called the Luddites","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/8.mp3"},{"answer":"destroying their knitting machines because they were so worried about losing their jobs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and ultimately, they didn't achieve anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/10-2023-07-14-17-09-15.mp3"},{"answer":"And anyway, industrialisation created more jobs than it destroyed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's true,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but it probably didn't seem a positive thing at the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I can see why the Luddites felt so threatened.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure I would have felt the same.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/16.mp3"},{"answer":"The discussion about the future of work was really optimistic for a change.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I like the idea that work won't involve doing boring, repetitive tasks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/18.mp3"},{"answer":"as robots will do all that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Normally, you only hear negative stuff about the future.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Bit too optimistic, don't you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/21.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, I can't see how people are about to have more leisure time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/22.mp3"},{"answer":"when all the evidence shows people are spending longer than ever at work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/23.mp3"},{"answer":"No, that's true.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/24.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about lower unemployment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not so sure about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps in the long term,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/27.mp3"},{"answer":"but not in the foreseeable future.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And I expect most people will be expected to work until they're much older","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/29.mp3"},{"answer":"as everyone's living much longer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/30.mp3"},{"answer":"That's already happening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I enjoyed all that stuff on how technology's changed some jobs","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and how they're likely to change in the near future.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, incredible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Like accountants.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/35.mp3"},{"answer":"You might think all the technological innovations would have put them out of a job,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/36.mp3"},{"answer":"but in fact there are more of them than ever.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/37.mp3"},{"answer":"They're still really in demand and have become far more efficient.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. That was amazing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Twenty times more accountants in this country compared to the 19th century.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd never have thought that demand for hairdressing would have gone up so much in the last hundred years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/42.mp3"},{"answer":"One hairdresser for every 287 people now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/43.mp3"},{"answer":"compared to one for over 1,500.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah because people's earning power has gone up so they can afford to spend more on personal services like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/45.mp3"},{"answer":"But technology hasn't changed the actual job that much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/46.mp3"},{"answer":"No, they've got hairdryers, etc.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/47.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's one job where you don't depend on a computer...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/48.mp3"},{"answer":"The kind of work that administrative staff do has changed enormously, thanks to technology.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Even 20 years ago there were secretaries doing dictation and typing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Really boring compared to these days,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/51.mp3"},{"answer":"when they're given much more responsibility and higher status.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/52.mp3"},{"answer":"A lot of graduates go in for this kind of work now...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd expected there to be a much bigger change in the number of agricultural workers in the 19th century.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/54.mp3"},{"answer":"But the 1871 census showed that roughly 25% of the population worked on the land.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I'd have assumed it would be more than 50%.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Now it's less than 0.2%.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... What about care workers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/58.mp3"},{"answer":"They barely existed in the 19th century","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/59.mp3"},{"answer":"as people's lifespan was so much shorter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/60.mp3"},{"answer":"But now of course this sector will see huge growth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and it's hard enough to meet current demand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/62.mp3"},{"answer":"The future looks quite bleak for bank clerks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/63.mp3"},{"answer":"They've been in decline since ATMs were introduced in the 80s.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/64.mp3"},{"answer":"And technology will certainly make most of the jobs they do now redundant, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I agree, although the situation may change.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/66.mp3"},{"answer":"It's very hard to predict what will happen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-3-2023-06-17-11-13-46/67.mp3"}]
